OL,3,GNEWSAMan on 'surreal' freedom after 20
OL,4,Ayears in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who spent 20 years in prison
OL,7,Fbefore a court ruled his original
OL,8,Fsentence was imposed in error has
OL,9,Fdescribed the feeling of freedom as
OL,10,F"surreal".
OL,12,FLuke Ings, from Bracknell, Berkshire,
OL,13,Fwas 17 when he was sentenced in 2006
OL,14,Fafter admitting offences including a
OL,15,Frobbery in an underpass and an assault
OL,16,Fon a teenager in a fast-food
OL,17,Frestaurant.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
