OL,3,GNEWSAMan on 'surreal' freedom after 20
OL,4,Ayears in jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was jailed for 21 months but held in
OL,7,Fcustody indefinitely under a detention
OL,8,Ffor public protection (DPP) sentence
OL,9,Funtil judges at Wolverhampton Crown
OL,10,FCourt ordered his release earlier this
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FThe 38-year-old told the Local
OL,14,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS)
OL,15,Feverything was now "amazing" to him and
OL,16,Fthat he hoped to get a job.
